function roundSpec(n){let out=[];let count=6+n*2;for(let i=0;i<count;i++){let k='red';if(n>=2&&i%5===1)k='blue';if(n>=3&&i%6===2)k='green';if(n>=4&&i%7===3)k='yellow';if(n>=5&&i%5===2)k='pink';if(n>=6&&i%9===4)k='black';if(n>=7&&i%10===5)k='white';if(n>=8&&i%11===6)k='lead';if(n>=10&&i%12===7)k='ceramic';out.push({kind:k,camo:n>=9&&i%7===0})}if(n===10||n===15||n===20)out.push({kind:'moab',camo:false});return out}
function startWave(){if(active||paused||lives<=0)return;if(wave>=20){winGame();return}wave++;active=true;spawnQueue=roundSpec(wave);spawnTimer=.15;roundElapsed=0;ui.callout.textContent=`ROUND ${wave}  •  HERE THEY COME!`;ui.callout.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>ui.callout.classList.remove('show'),1550);updateUI()}
function winGame(){active=false;document.getElementById('overTitle').textContent='Meadow saved!';document.getElementById('overText').textContent='You popped every last bloon. What a ranger!';ui.over.classList.add('show')}
function gameOver(){active=false;document.getElementById('overTitle').textContent='Trail over!';document.getElementById('overText').textContent='The bloons made it through. Give it another go!';ui.over.classList.add('show')}
function addTower(type,x,y){let def=types[type];if(towers.length>=8){showToast('Your crew is full! (8 defenders max)');return}if(cash<def.cost){showToast('Not enough bananas!');return}if(distPath(x,y)<56){showToast('Too close to the trail — find a grassy spot!');return}if(towers.some(t=>Math.hypot(t.x-x,t.y-y)<44)){showToast('Give your pals a little room!');return}let t={type,x,y,level:1,cool:0,angle:0,total:0};towers.push(t);cash-=def.cost;selectTower(t);updateUI()}
function selectTower(t){selectedTower=t;if(!t){ui.upgrade.classList.remove('open');return}ui.upgrade.classList.add('open');document.getElementById('selectedEmoji').textContent=types[t.type].emoji;document.getElementById('selectedName').textContent=types[t.type].name;document.getElementById('selectedLevel').textContent=`Level ${t.level} · ${t.level===1?'Trail scout':t.level===2?'Sharpened aim':'Super popper'}`;document.getElementById('upgradeBtn').disabled=t.level>=2;document.getElementById('upgradeBtn2').disabled=t.level>=3;document.getElementById('upgradeBtn').innerHTML=t.level>=2?'✓ MAX':'◉ <span>180</span>';document.getElementById('upgradeBtn2').innerHTML=t.level>=3?'✓ MAX':'◉ <span>320</span>'}
function upgradeTower(amount){if(!selectedTower)return;if(selectedTower.level>=3){showToast('Already fully upgraded!');return}if(cash<amount){showToast('Not enough bananas!');return}cash-=amount;selectedTower.level++;selectTower(selectedTower);showToast('Looking sharp! Upgrade unlocked ✨');updateUI()}
function fire(t,target){t.cool=types[t.type].rate*(t.level===2?.76:t.level===3?.62);let dx=target.x-t.x,dy=target.y-t.y;t.angle=Math.atan2(dy,dx);if(t.type==='cannon'){shots.push({x:t.x,y:t.y-9,tx:target.x,ty:target.y,target,spd:types[t.type].shotSpeed,kind:'bomb',damage:t.level===3?4:2,splash:types[t.type].splash+ t.level*8})}else if(t.type==='boomer'){shots.push({x:t.x,y:t.y-15,tx:target.x,ty:target.y,target,spd:types[t.type].shotSpeed,kind:'boomer',damage:t.level===3?2:1,age:0,originX:t.x,originY:t.y})}else{shots.push({x:t.x,y:t.y-16,tx:target.x,ty:target.y,target,spd:types[t.type].shotSpeed,kind:t.type==='ninja'?'star':'dart',damage:t.level===3?2:1})}}
function update(dt){gameTime+=dt;if(toastTimer>0){toastTimer-=dt;if(toastTimer<=0)ui.toast.classList.remove('show')}if(active){roundElapsed+=dt;spawnTimer-=dt;if(spawnQueue.length&&spawnTimer<=0){let s=spawnQueue.shift();addBloon(s.kind,0,s.camo);spawnTimer=Math.max(.22,.72-wave*.016)}for(let i=bloons.length-1;i>=0;i--){let b=bloons[i];b.dist+=b.speed*dt;if(b.dist>=pathLength){bloons.splice(i,1);lives=Math.max(0,lives-(b.kind==='moab'?30:b.kind==='ceramic'?8:1));if(lives===0)gameOver()}}
